   "meaning": "colour of the RGB LED strip left of Start (the mode switch side), linear RGB 0..1 as an array [r, g, b]; the page turns the firmware sRGB bytes into linear ((v / 255) ** 2.2 or the exact sRGB curve); an object {r, g, b} is ignored by the player",
   "readByStage": true
  },
  {
   "id": "led_left_level",
   "kind": "number",
   "default": 0,
